    "userdoc.containers.storage.p": "Containers can optionally mount a volume at <code>/data</code>. When using the controller workload path, specify the storage backend and size:",
    "userdoc.containers.workload.p1": "Alternatively, create a container workload through the controller:",
    "userdoc.containers.workload.p2": "The direct node path (<code>--node</code>) sends the request straight to the node agent. The workload path goes through the controller, which handles scheduling, records the workload in its state, and pushes the desired configuration to the target node.",
