    "docs.hub.related": "<strong>Related:</strong> the <a href=\"blog/first-node-debian12-quickstart.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent-primary);\">Debian 12 quickstart blog post</a> walks through a full terminal session with an embedded recording.",
    "docs.hub.technical": "Technical architecture, networking, replication, and contributor documentation lives in the <a href=\"https://github.com/kcorehypervisor/kcore/tree/main/docs\" style=\"color: var(--accent-primary);\">docs/ directory</a> of the kcore repository.",
