    "userdoc.vmmig.limitsLi3": "Drain अभी प्रति VM live migrate prefer नहीं करता — live चाहिए तो <code>kctl migrate vm</code> उपयोग करें।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.limitsLi2": "Live migration fixed 18000–18127 range से destination port लेता है; members के बीच host firewalls खोलें।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.limitsLi1": "filesystem, LVM, या ZFS-backed VMs के लिए nodes के बीच समर्थित नहीं।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.limits": "Limits",
    "userdoc.vmmig.techNote": "Contributor-level detail (RPC names, systemd handoff, RBD features): kcore repository में <a href=\"https://github.com/kcorehypervisor/kcore/blob/main/docs/vm-migration.md\">docs/vm-migration.md</a>।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatCold3": "Destination Nix VM define करता है → RBD map और Cloud Hypervisor start।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatCold2": "Source Nix अब VM define नहीं करता → unit stop।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatCold1": "Controller <code>node_id</code> reassign करता है (volume row unchanged)।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatCold": "Cold",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatLive4": "Source unit stop और RBD mapping unmap।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatLive3": "Controller <code>node_id</code> move करता है, config push; destination systemd live-migrated marker के ज़रिए running process adopt करता है।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatLive2": "Destination <code>vm.receive-migration</code> से listen; source <code>vm.send-migration</code> से <code>tcp:&lt;dest-ip&gt;:&lt;port&gt;</code> पर call।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatLive1": "Destination RBD image map करता है और केवल API socket के साथ Cloud Hypervisor start।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatLive": "Live",
    "userdoc.vmmig.whatHappens": "Under the hood क्या होता है",
    "userdoc.vmmig.coldP1": "source पर हर VM control plane में reassign होता है। Nix push source पर units हटाता है और destinations पर बनाता है। Ceph disks remap — copy नहीं। guests full stop/start अनुभव करते हैं।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.cold": "Node cold drain करें",
    "userdoc.vmmig.liveP2": "Success responses <code>mode=live</code> report करते हैं (fallback चला तो <code>mode=cold</code>)।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.liveP1": "Controller destination पर empty Cloud Hypervisor तैयार करता है (shared RBD पहले से mapped), source से guest memory TCP पर stream, VM owner node update, Nix push, फिर systemd destination पर migrated process adopt और source cleanup।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.live": "VM live migrate करें",
    "userdoc.vmmig.prereqLi4": "Roles: <code>migrate vm</code> के लिए <code>vm-admin</code>; <code>drain</code> और <code>migrate reset-session</code> के लिए <code>cluster-admin</code>।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.prereqLi3": "Live: migration stream के लिए node IPs के बीच TCP 18000–18127 (Ceph public/client जैसा fabric ठीक)।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.prereqLi2": "VM <code>--storage-backend ceph</code> से create।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.prereqLi1": "Healthy <code>CephCluster</code>; दोनों nodes members।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.prereq": "Prerequisites",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdLiveWhen": "host बदलते समय workload running रखें",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdLiveDown": "hypervisor cutover के दौरान brief pause",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdLiveCmd": "<code>kctl migrate vm …</code>",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdLive": "<strong>Live</strong>",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdColdWhen": "maintenance के लिए node evacuate; live fail हो तो fallback",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdColdDown": "Guest source पर stop और destination पर start",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdColdCmd": "<code>kctl drain node …</code>",
    "userdoc.vmmig.tdCold": "<strong>Cold</strong>",
    "userdoc.vmmig.thWhen": "When to use",
    "userdoc.vmmig.thDowntime": "Downtime",
    "userdoc.vmmig.thCommand": "Command",
    "userdoc.vmmig.thMode": "Mode",
    "userdoc.vmmig.compare": "Cold vs live",
    "userdoc.vmmig.intro": "Shared RBD का मतलब VM host बदलने पर guest disk copy नहीं होता। cold reassignment (Nix के ज़रिए stop/start) या Cloud Hypervisor live migration (दोनों nodes same image map करते हुए TCP पर memory) चुनें।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.note": "Cold drain और live migration के लिए <strong>kcore SAN</strong> (<code>storage_backend: ceph</code>) चाहिए। Local filesystem / LVM / ZFS disks एक node पर रहते हैं। <a href=\"storage-vsan.html\">kcore SAN (Ceph)</a> देखें।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.title": "VM migration",
    "userdoc.kctlref.migrate.vm.desc": "Ceph-backed VM को <code>--target-node</code> पर live-migrate। Optional <code>--allow-cold-fallback</code>। GPU VM same family के free GPU पर cold-migrate, या <code>--gpu</code> पर। <a href=\"vm-migration.html\">VM migration</a> और <a href=\"gpu-passthrough.html\">GPU passthrough</a> देखें।",
    "userdoc.kctlref.migrate.vm.cmd": "<code>vm</code>",
    "userdoc.kctlref.h2.migrate": "migrate",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrateP2": "Operator runbook: <a href=\"vm-migration.html\">VM migration</a>। Architecture और RPC flow: <a href=\"https://github.com/kcorehypervisor/kcore/blob/main/docs/vm-migration.md\">docs/vm-migration.md</a> · Ceph integration: <a href=\"https://github.com/kcorehypervisor/kcore/blob/main/docs/ceph.md\">docs/ceph.md</a>।",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrateLi3": "<strong>Fallback:</strong> <code>kctl migrate vm … --allow-cold-fallback</code> live try, फिर उस VM के लिए cold।",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrateLi2": "<strong>Cold:</strong> <code>kctl drain node &lt;node&gt;</code> — control plane VMs reassign; source stop / destination start।",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrateLi1": "<strong>Live:</strong> <code>kctl migrate vm &lt;id&gt; --target-node &lt;node&gt;</code> — memory TCP पर stream; cutover के दौरान दोनों nodes same image map।",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrateP1": "Disk pool <code>kcore-vms</code> में RBD image है, host बदलने पर guest blocks copy नहीं। downtime budget के अनुसार mode चुनें:",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.opsMigrate": "VMs move करना (cold और live)",
    "docs.hub.card.vmmig.desc": "Shared RBD पर cold drain और Cloud Hypervisor live migration।",
    "docs.hub.card.vmmig.title": "VM migration",
