    "userdoc.networks.h2.vmattach": "VM network attachment",
    "userdoc.networks.intro": "kcore VMs के लिए तीन types: NAT, bridge, VXLAN। प्रत्येक Linux bridge: आमतौर <code>kbr-&lt;name&gt;</code>; 15 char limit exceed हो तो hashed <code>kb-…</code>। NAT/bridge DHCP/masquerade; VXLAN multi-node L2 overlay।",
    "userdoc.networks.nat": "Linux bridge dnsmasq DHCP (.100–.199) और nftables masquerade + DNAT <code>externalIP</code> से। single-node only।",
