    "userdoc.storagevsan.integrationLi1": "<strong>Phase 1 (shipped):</strong> day-2 <code>CephCluster</code> YAML <code>kctl apply</code> से apply — controller reconciler NixOS <code>services.ceph</code> configure करता है, MON/MGR/OSD bootstrap (<code>ceph-volume</code> OSD disk पर), cluster health track करता है। OSDs <em>not</em> node install <code>--storage-backend</code> के ज़रिए create होते।",
    "userdoc.storagevsan.integrationLi2": "<strong>Phase 2 (shipped):</strong> RBD pool <code>--storage-backend ceph</code> VMs; volumes cluster-scoped any member map; cold drain disks copy नहीं।",
