    "userdoc.certs.renewal.p2": "Rotation controller driven key material not। controller <code>RotateNodeCert</code> node call, node fresh keypair CSR <code>SignNodeCsr</code>, sub-CA signed chain। private keys node leave never।",
    "userdoc.certs.renewal.p3": "node new certificate key atomic write, TLS reload process restart without। gRPC connections drop reconnect; in-memory state kept। new certificate verification fail rollback old valid certificate serve।",
    "userdoc.certs.h2.revocation": "Revocation: CRL and OCSP",
    "userdoc.certs.revocation.p": "controller signed certificate inventory: serial, subject, node, validity, SHA-256 fingerprint, status। revoke inventory mark CRL OCSP publish।",
    "userdoc.certs.revocation.p2": "CRL sub-CA signed <code>thisUpdate</code> <code>nextUpdate</code>; 24 hours valid revocation set change या <code>nextUpdate</code> close regenerate। <code>--reason</code> RFC 5280 codes <code>key-compromise</code>, <code>superseded</code>, <code>privilege-withdrawn</code>।",
    "userdoc.certs.revocation.p3": "Revocation TLS above not handshake inside: revoked peer TLS handshake complete then <code>PermissionDenied</code> RPC handler before। revoked certificate no call success। snapshot refresh 60 seconds। snapshot stale controller soft-fail default revocation outage cluster lock out prevent; <code>revocation.failMode</code> <code>hard-fail</code> stale data reject peers।",
    "userdoc.certs.revocation.note": "OCSP stapling not supported। controller OCSP responder nodes query directly CRL stale fallback — kcore handshake stapled response attach no।",
    "userdoc.certs.h2.pkiendpoints": "PKI endpoints",
    "userdoc.certs.pkiendpoints.p": "controller CRL OCSP plain HTTP <code>pki.httpListenAddr</code>, default <code>0.0.0.0:9092</code>। signed transport security need no; expired certificate node fetch recover need।",
    "userdoc.certs.pkiendpoints.li1": "<code>GET /pki/crl.der</code> और <code>GET /pki/crl.pem</code> — current CRL",
    "userdoc.certs.pkiendpoints.li2": "<code>POST /pki/ocsp</code> और <code>GET /pki/ocsp/&lt;base64&gt;</code> — OCSP responder good, revoked, unknown",
    "userdoc.certs.pkiendpoints.li3": "<code>GET /pki/healthz</code> — responder health",
    "userdoc.certs.pkiendpoints.p2": "<code>pki.httpEnabled: false</code> listener off। nodes gRPC <code>GetCrl</code> fallback either way।",
    "userdoc.compliance.impl.li9": "CRL OCSP certificate revocation every RPC enforce (<a href=\"certificates.html\">certificates &amp; encryption</a>)",
    "userdoc.compliance.impl.li10": "RBAC operator roles per-operator client certificates",
