    "userdoc.vmmig.troubleAeP2": "automatic reaping no deliberate। outside session dead guess wrong in-flight migration tear down। kcore evidence report call you।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.troubleAeP3": "per node inspect session tracked, reserved port listening, receive VMM pid alive VM belong (recycled pid recycled not live), handoff marker API socket verdict। unreachable node reported whole report fail not। inspect <code>read-only</code>; clear <code>cluster-admin</code>।",
    "userdoc.vmmig.troubleAeP4": "clearing session port reservation release, receive VMM kill, marker pid API socket files remove, destination RBD unmap। idempotent no session success। <code>--node</code> mandatory controller VM owner node refuse। session gone migration retry normal।",
