    "userdoc.kctlref.migrate.sessionNote": "controller mid-flight die तो receive session migration outlive; बाद की migration उस VM destination पर <code>ALREADY_EXISTS</code> fail। automatic clear नहीं। पहले <code>kctl get migrate-session &lt;vm&gt;</code> inspect (read-only; <code>--node</code> बिना हर <code>CephCluster</code> member query), फिर <code>kctl migrate reset-session &lt;vm&gt; --node &lt;id&gt; --force</code> clear। alive receive VMM session clear in-flight migration kill। <a href=\"vm-migration.html\">VM migration</a> देखें।",
